WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:02,430
Why is this pile of scrap still sitting here?

2
00:00:02,430 --> 00:00:03,430
I'll take care of it now

3
00:00:04,430 --> 00:00:05,430
Life is good this time

4
00:00:05,430 --> 00:00:17,250
It's a pity that the space backpack is full of classes

5
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:18,250
It can't fit in so many houses

6
00:00:18,250 --> 00:00:20,250
Store it in the trunk first

7
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:21,250
Good night, young man

8
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:23,250
Then send it to Liaotian Hall for transaction

9
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:34,020
Curry Weitu 400-500 packs

10
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:35,020
One hundred bottles of chili sauce

11
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:37,020
And braised beef noodles Qianhao

12
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:39,020
It only cost a dozen survival coins in total.

13
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:40,020
It’s good to have a work permit

14
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:41,020
There are no more second-tier cars left.
